---
/**
 * Citation — extrait du carnet d'immersion, fond marine profond avec caustiques.
 */
---

<section class="relative bg-plongee-abysse text-plongee-ecume py-24 md:py-36 px-6 md:px-10 overflow-hidden">
  <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-[0.12] pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen" viewBox="0 0 800 600" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <filter id="cite-caustic" x="-50%" y="-50%" width="200%" height="200%">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.012 0.018" numOctaves="2" seed="5"/>
        <feColorMatrix values="0 0 0 0 0.25  0 0 0 0 0.66  0 0 0 0 0.84  0 0 0 1 0"/>
      </filter>
    </defs>
    <rect width="800" height="600" filter="url(#cite-caustic)"/>
  </svg>

  <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <span class="scroll-reveal block font-space-grotesk font-bold text-plongee-lagon/25 leading-none" style="font-size: clamp(120px, 18vw, 220px);" aria-hidden="true">
      &laquo;
    </span>

    <blockquote class="scroll-reveal -mt-12 md:-mt-20 font-space-grotesk italic font-light text-plongee-ecume leading-[1.18] tracking-tight" style="font-size: clamp(30px, 4.8vw, 54px);">
      Sous l'eau, on n'enseigne pas le calme.
      <span class="block mt-3 not-italic font-bold text-plongee-lagon">On enseigne à le retrouver, palier après palier.</span>
    </blockquote>

    <footer class="scroll-reveal mt-12 flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="block w-12 h-px bg-plongee-corail" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="font-jetbrains uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-plongee-ecume/65 text-[11px]">
        Carnet d'immersion — niveau 1
      </p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</section>
